B.cUH=new A.q("attachmentTypes",B.X,'Child `type` values treated as attachment OBJECTS (e.g. ["image","wireframe","sheets","docs","sketchpad"]). At the LOG level each renders as a proper ENTRY CARD housing its object (author line + tile/inline editor) in stream order \u2014 never a loose tile on the log surface; INSIDE a comment they render as tiles on that entry. Tap opens FULL-SCREEN (back returns to the log).',B.f,null)
