B.cZK=new A.q("layers",B.X,"Opt-in ORDERED layer toolkit: a List of {id, label, kind, on?, ...kind-specific config reusing the legacy prop shapes (markers: colorColumn/colors/cluster/maxMarkers; network: linesAsset2/lineColor2/lineWidth2/linesFilterProperty2; choropleth: choropleth + optional pickColumns; geojson: geojsonAsset/geojson; labels: no extra config \u2014 toggles marker caption pills)}. 2+ entries render a compact collapsible layer panel (top-right) with a toggle per layer (choropleth rows also surface their metric-pick chips); toggle state is ephemeral/session-only, never written back to board JSON. Absent/under-2 \u2192 today's exact rendering (legacy flat props + overlayToggle/linesToggle chips), fully unchanged.",B.f,null)
