B.cTB=new A.q("resetSignal",B.X,"{table, id, column} \u2014 same shape as focusSignal, but a change clears the field's own visible text and fires its `action` with an empty string, so bound downstream state clears too. Optional; distinct from focusSignal so one external toggle can choose either behavior per host-side state.",B.f,null)
