B.cDB=new A.d2("textinput",'A single-line free-text field \u2014 the `slider` $value-substitution pattern generalized from numeric to text. On every change (debounced) AND on submit (immediate) it can fire an `action` (any literal "$value" in args, however deeply nested, is substituted with the field\'s current text first \u2014 an empty field still fires, so a "clear" is expressible). No table binding of its own; drives whatever action the applet author wires (e.g. a debounced search-as-you-type `http` fetch).',B.bx1,!1)
