B.cCX=new A.d2("datanow",'CONTROL block: a movable "NOW" for a schedule dataset \u2014 a scrub slider, an optional play button that rolls the clock forward through the event day(s), and a "Now" button that snaps back to the real wall clock. It publishes NO filter. Instead it projects a synthetic STATUS column onto every row read through visibleRows, reading Live / Upcoming / Finished relative to the current now, so any existing configSource:"board" view paints it with machinery it already has (map colorColumn+colors, cards tags, the filter sheet). Rows carry their schedule as two NUMERIC ordinals in any monotonic unit; absolute minutes since the first day\'s midnight is the natural choice for a multi-day programme.',B.bEj,!1)
