B.cE5=new A.d2("switch","Render one of several children chosen by the value of a column on the injected row \u2014 a type-aware detail (e.g. a text item shows a record, a wireframe item shows an embed). Host keys (rowId/editGuard/table) flow to the chosen child so it binds to the same row.",B.bhR,!1)
